#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1325 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "The Define-XML declares DM but carries no description for it, so the define_dataset_label guard keeps the rule silent instead of flagging every dataset label as a mismatch against an empty declaration."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#define dataset-metadata DM name=DM
dataset DM label="Demography"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col AGE     type=Num  label="Age"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 56
